<title>USA: Lehman Brothers Holdings sets $300 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers Holdings sets $300 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Wednesday, said lead manager Lehman Brothers Inc. The issue was increased in size by $50 million.</p>
<p>BORROWER LEHMAN BROTHERS HOLDINGS INC</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.25	    MATURITY 10/15/03</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.633     PAY DATE 4/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA1    SPREAD 88BP	    PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  YIELD 7.318 PCT	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTES PRICED OVER 5.75 PCT U.S. TREASURY DUE 2003 --U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
